# Strip notebook outputs automatically for anyone who has run `nbstripout --install`
# (see notebooks/README.md). This just declares the filter; each collaborator still
# needs to install it once locally.
*.ipynb filter=nbstripout

# Keep bibliography/text diffs sane
*.bib text
*.tex text
*.qmd text

# Uncomment and use Git LFS if figures/notebooks start including large binary files
# (e.g. large plots, datasets, videos). Requires `git lfs install` once per clone.
# *.pdf filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.mp4 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
